    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I reproduced this on latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12.x\n\n### Description\n\nOccurs only if you open config inside plugin folder directly by file name. No such bug with `--clean`\n\n### Reproduction\n\n1. `cd ~/.config/nvim/plugin`\n1. `nvim 10_options.lua`\n2. `:restart`\n3. results in an empty buffer",
